WEBVTT

NOTE Draft subtitles for "friends" — timed to the shot plan. Re-time to the final edit.

1
00:04.300 --> 00:07.800
So, Faisal, what happened with your project?

2
00:08.300 --> 00:13.800
Still researching. I’ve been following Pi Network — there’s a big community and apps being built on it.

3
00:14.300 --> 00:18.800
Pi? The one people mine on their phones? What’s it actually for?

4
00:19.300 --> 00:24.800
That’s the right question. The real value is in use — useful apps people actually use.

5
00:25.300 --> 00:29.800
Look — this is DigitalSaudi. It opens in the Pi Browser at digitalsaudi.pi.

6
00:35.300 --> 00:37.800
Is this price fixed?

7
00:38.300 --> 00:43.800
No, it’s for information only. It comes from exchanges, it changes, and it shows the source.

8
00:50.300 --> 00:53.800
Good that they say it: never give your passphrase to anyone.

9
00:54.300 --> 00:59.800
Exactly. And there are Umrah and city guides and lots of tools — free.

10
01:00.300 --> 01:02.800
Send me the link.

11
01:07.300 --> 01:09.800
Discover Saudi Arabia. Explore useful digital tools. Learn about the Pi ecosystem with DigitalSaudi.
